  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO BREAST CANCER AWARENESS MONTH - THINKING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project builds on previous programme support grants to the Foundation and the primary objective is to increase awareness and prevention of breast cancer and the available treatment services for Breast Cancer in Sierra Leone. The same activities will continue during the October 2023 program that include awareness raising campaigns to provide education about the importance of early detection and offer free breast screening through the designated outlets; engagement of women, girls and men on the signs and symptoms of breast cancer through demonstration on how to conduct self-breast cancer examination; conduct media and communication campaign through radio and television stations and continue to provide regular clinical services to women, girls and men nationwide, mostly targeting the vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
